  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.3 (hardening, all additive): enums are written by name in JSON and EF Core stores (integer values still load) through the new shared FormazeJson options; the JSON file store writes atomically and serializes per key; new AddFormazeEfCoreWithFactory<TContext>() opens a DbContext per operation and the insert race is retried as an update; license diagnostics are logged (tier, expiry, domain, and why a key fell back to Free) and Formaze:LicenseKey is read from configuration; IFormazeLocalizer lets you add or override any UI string, and the last hard-coded editor strings are now localized in EN/FR/ES/DE; DataAnnotations messages show under every field type, Enter in a tags field no longer submits, MudBlazor RequiredError is localized, read-only is honoured on file/radio/slider, TimeSpan? clears to null; XML docs shipped. The full history ships in the package as CHANGELOG.md.",
